  "releaseNotes": "Updated to .NET Standard 2.0, .NET 8.0, and ServiceWire 7.0.0. Adds configurable file and memory stores plus the optional ServiceMq.Sqlite provider; durability and capacity policies; atomic portable file persistence; visibility timeouts; dead-letter replay; storage health and maintenance APIs; independent audit retention and payload policies; and optional authenticated AES protection. Existing constructors and legacy queue records remain supported.",
